    "music": null,
    "description": {
      "text": "\tThe Syndicate has a generous vacation policy on Foundry that allows workers to take as much as a month of vacation time every year, and many choose to take that time to escape from the cities and explore the wilderness. The shipyards claim that this vacation time is partly responsible for the high reliability of the ships built here, because a well-rested and relaxed worker is less likely to make the sort of mistakes that can quickly become disastrous in outer space.",
      "toDisplay": null
    },
    "spaceport": {
      "text": "\tEverything is made of gleaming metal, and each tower is slightly tapered and adorned with painted fins that make it resemble an enormous starship.",
      "toDisplay": null
    },
