    "landscapes": [],
    "music": null,
    "description": {
      "text": "This is the home world of the Hai. Well over half the planet's surface is oceans. The land is mostly covered by sprawling cities, except for some mountain ranges too high or too snowy to build on. Despite its population of nearly eight billion, Hai-home is relatively free of pollution or overcrowding.",
      "toDisplay": null
    },
    "spaceport": {
      "text": "The spaceport in the capital city of Haimat is massive, with towers well over a kilometer high and hangars large enough to park an entire fleet of capital ships in. Although the port is bustling, with ships taking off and landing almost every minute, nearly three quarters of the landing pads and hangars are empty, and whole sections of the spaceport appear to be unused. Clearly, this port was designed to handle far more traffic than this.",
      "toDisplay": null
    },
