    "music": null,
    "description": {
      "text": "\tThe shipyards of Lionheart Industries are located here. Centuries ago, warships built here turned the tide of the Alpha War, and today the ships designed and built in the Deep continue to be some of the most technologically advanced ships in human space - and the most expensive.",
      "toDisplay": null
    },
    "spaceport": {
      "text": "\tDespite the Deep's importance to defeating the Alphas, Remembrance Day is seldom observed in the region. The only thing you see out of the ordinary is a milk dish on the counter of an information booth.",
      "toDisplay": [
        "\"days since year start\" > 35",
        "\"days since year start\" < 55"
      ]
    },
